    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One seemingly ordinary morning, you arrive at school only to discover that all your classmates have vanished without a trace. Determined to rescue them, you follow the clues that lead you to the ominous Tower of Shadows \u2014 where your friends are imprisoned, desperately awaiting a hero. The bus of destiny is calling. Step aboard and begin your adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn While Playing, Play While Learning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master essential 2nd\u20133rd grade math skills through integrated quizzes woven into classic turn-based RPG gameplay. The game encourages children to actively explore knowledge, using spatial memory techniques to enhance learning and retention. Math has never been this exciting or accessible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through intricate mazes and climb to the summit of the Tower of Shadows. Wield an arsenal of weapons, items, and power-ups to defeat Slimes, Demon Cats, and other forces of darkness. Conquer fearsome bosses, rescue your friends, and solve math quizzes in the midst of battle. Become the hero of your class \u2014 triumph not just through strength, but through wit!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One seemingly ordinary morning, you arrive at school only to discover that all your classmates have vanished without a trace. Determined to rescue them, you follow the clues that lead you to the ominous Tower of Shadows \u2014 where your friends are imprisoned, desperately awaiting a hero. The bus of destiny is calling. Step aboard and begin your adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn While Playing, Play While Learning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master essential 2nd\u20133rd grade math skills through integrated quizzes woven into classic turn-based RPG gameplay. The game encourages children to actively explore knowledge, using spatial memory techniques to enhance learning and retention. Math has never been this exciting or accessible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through intricate mazes and climb to the summit of the Tower of Shadows. Wield an arsenal of weapons, items, and power-ups to defeat Slimes, Demon Cats, and other forces of darkness. Conquer fearsome bosses, rescue your friends, and solve math quizzes in the midst of battle. Become the hero of your class \u2014 triumph not just through strength, but through wit!</p>",
    "short_description": "Learning math has never been this thrilling! Slash monsters while looking your best in stylish, badass outfits. Navigate labyrinths, defeat monsters, conquer mighty bosses \u2014 all while tackling 2nd\u20133rd grade math quizzes right in the heat of battle.",
